# File Standards

## Required File Structure
All classes must follow this region organization:
```csharp
#region Inspector Configuration
#endregion

#region Manager References
#endregion

#region Runtime State
#endregion

#region Properties
#endregion

#region Unity Lifecycle
#endregion

#region Public API
#endregion

#region Private Methods
#endregion

#region Debug
#endregion
```

## Complete Unit Rule
Modifications must be complete functional units:
- Complete methods from signature to closing brace
- Method clusters that work together cohesively
- Complete properties including getters/setters
- NOT partial method bodies
- NOT incomplete control structures
- NOT individual lines within complex methods

## File Size Limits
- Core Components: 600 lines max
- Manager Classes: 400 lines max
- Utility Classes: 300 lines max
- Data Classes: 200 lines max
- Interfaces: 100 lines max
